text = "Level Designer, you can delete this later.

A 13th century inn with four floors. Devin sleeps here. Run by Ishmael Harris.

This is a large building, and it should probably be CLOSE in size to the Copper Kettle (but smaller), where you can use the copper_kettle_interior.tscn level as a loose guide."
